translate schinese story46_Erik_Lyna_Helga_4ffdb80e:
    h "小姐，你是要把这些全做完？！"

translate schinese story46_Erik_Lyna_Helga_fb60e607:
    l "拜托嘛~妈咪……？"

translate schinese story46_Erik_Lyna_Helga_382dc087:
    l "我想明天打扮得惊艳全场，而且……蛋糕也不会自己做好！"

translate schinese story46_Erik_Lyna_Helga_2d8468f4:
