translate schinese story47_Lyna_Helga_34e8e6f5:
    lm "这双手臂，那个小腹……紧实得要命，性感死了！"

translate schinese story47_Lyna_Helga_7566054d:
    h "我确实非常引以为傲……"

translate schinese story47_Lyna_Helga_3022f268:
