translate schinese story47_Lyna_Helga_7c40991a:
    h "你在干嘛？小心点！"

translate schinese story47_Lyna_Helga_68ced00a:
    l "我又没有女武神那么高，很难够到东西啦，哈哈！"

translate schinese story47_Lyna_Helga_87fa049b:
    h "什么……？"

translate schinese story47_Lyna_Helga_6f3ffd85:
    l "看，这个是肯定要买的。"

translate schinese story47_Lyna_Helga_14a2b6f9:
    h "哦！所以你刚才是——不！不行，女士！"

translate schinese story47_Lyna_Helga_fedab585:
